  stickyNoteInfos:
  - title: CONTACT / dense low smoke
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 600
      y: 80
      width: 520
      height: 430
    contents: 'Wheel axle = local X. Forward = +Z. Rear wake = -Z. Ground = local
      Y 0.

      Wheel center Y = WheelRadius + 0.035. Default radius .65 m, width
      .34 m.

      Blackboard edits: EmissionRate / WheelRadius / WheelWidth / WrapAngularSpeed
      (rad/s) / WakeSpeed / Opacity / SmokeColor / SizeMultiplier.

      Local-space
      stationary wheel preview. Vehicle contact/slip binding and moving-vehicle world-space
      release are a later integration step.

      Native VFX blocks only; no runtime
      script or Custom HLSL.'
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Medium
    colorTheme: 0
